# AI Voice Command Center Design & Engineering Protocol

## Architectural Directives
- **Category**: web-design
- **Target Format**: website
- **Recommended Design System**: Agentic
- **Primary Aesthetic**: Cyberpunk HUD, Glassmorphism, 3D Canvas Accents, High Contrast Dark Mode

## Key Requirements
- High visual polish with 3D or micro-animations
- Full responsiveness across mobile, tablet, and ultra-wide screens
- Strict accessibility compliance (WCAG AA, semantic HTML)
- Built-in SEO metadata and JSON-LD schema
- Safe modular code structure with error boundaries

## Research Findings & Citations
- [Voice UI Design Guide 2026 | VUI Best Practices &amp; Examples](https://fuselabcreative.com/voice-user-interface-design-guide-2026/): Complete guide to voice user interface design: VUI principles, conversation design, and best practices for natural voice experiences in 2026.
- [Voice UI Design Guide 2026: Advanced Trends &amp; Best Practices- Thedan.design](https://thedan.design/insights/voice-ui-design-in-2026-best-practices-prototyping-and-the-future-of-conversational-ux/): Master Voice UI design in 2026 with hybrid AI, multimodal integration, agentic interfaces, and accessibility principles. This in-depth guide delivers frameworks, prototyping tools, and strategies to create natural, delightful conversational experiences that outperform 2020-era voice assistants.
- [Voice UI Design: Best Practices, Examples &amp; Inspiration (2026)](https://www.eleken.co/blog-posts/voice-ui-design): Looking for voice UI design inspiration? We share best practices, real-world examples, prototyping tips, and future trends to help you build smarter conversational UX in 2026.
- [2026 voice UI design guide for AI products | Lazarev.agency](https://www.lazarev.agency/articles/voice-ui-design): Learn how voice UI design turns AI voice agents into products people keep using: patterns, costs, and design decisions from Lazarev.agency.

## Implementation Guidelines
1. Research design tokens and apply typography ''Space Grotesk', 'Inter', sans-serif'.
2. Construct modular components with semantic markup.
3. Integrate real-time state feedback and audio-reactive 3D visualizers when appropriate.
4. Double check security, input sanitization, and responsiveness.
